  "title": "Waymo and Toyota Expand Robotaxi Partnership",
  "summary": "Waymo partners with Toyota to supply electric bZ4X vehicles for Japan and the UK, marking a significant step toward commercializing autonomous driving technology. The partnership aims to enhance the adoption of self-driving vehicles in these regions.",
